    "attributes": {
        "action": "Better international cooperation to halt sanctioned tankers carrying Russian oil",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "We call on the Government to improve cooperation with other maritime nations to monitor Russian shadow fleet vessels being loaded with oil, and arrest them once in international waters, and ensure that activity is shared with Ukraine.",
